'' A MODULE BUILD FOR MACH-O COMPILES: the finaliser stack and its two procedures are
'' linkonce_odr with no COMDAT (Mach-O has none), and the root's '__tko_initall' goes in
'' llvm.global_ctors at 65534 rather than a numbered section. Compile only -- the link
'' needs ld64 (docs/tiko-macos M2).
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TKO_MODCACHE=build/.mct-mac/cache
'' CLEAN: build/.mct-mac
'' CLEAN: build/.mct-mac/obj
'' ARGS: -c -m main -target macos-arm64 -i tests/modules/src/init/libs tests/modules/src/init/app/main.bas -o build/.mct-mac/obj/main.o
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: build/.mct-mac/obj/main.o
'' EXPECT-FILE-HAS: build/.mct-mac/obj/main.o :: ___tko_initall
'' EXPECT-FILE-HAS: build/.mct-mac/obj/main.o :: ___tko_modfini_drain
